From e9758d24f93ff6298b76e278e54db66bcc08200e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: huzhaolun <huzhaolun@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:09:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] feat(discovery): resolve the server configuration from
 a discovery URL

Adds a discovery endpoint so the client can follow id_server, relay_server,
api_server and key from one HTTPS/HTTP document instead of hard-coding them.
The overrides live in memory only, so removing the URL restores the manual
settings, and a failed fetch keeps the last good answer.

The endpoint is watched from the module itself rather than hooked into
flutter_ffi.rs, which upstream edits often; that file stays byte-identical
with upstream so daily syncs do not conflict there.
